{"sha": "40789235c86b9027881aec8d224891379223c2e16399ba7ffa31bb4b1490e98a", "body": ["\\emph{情形 $i = k$。}先对 $u_k$", "在 $\\intco0\\infty$ 上积分：", "\\begin{align*}", "\\int_{H^k}\\dd\\eta &= (-1)^{k-1}\\int_{\\R^{k-1}}", "\\Bigl(\\int_0^\\infty\\partial_kf\\,\\dd u_k\\Bigr)\\dd u' \\\\", "&= (-1)^{k-1}\\int_{\\R^{k-1}}\\bigl(0 - f(u', 0)\\bigr)\\dd u'", "= (-1)^k\\int_{\\R^{k-1}}f(u',0)\\,\\dd u' .", "\\end{align*}", "边界一侧，$\\eta$ 的限制为 $f(u',", "0)\\,\\dd u_1\\wedge\\dots\\wedge\\dd u_{k-1}$，诱导", "定向为标准定向的 $(-1)^k$ 倍，于是", "$\\int_{\\partial H^k}\\eta =", "(-1)^k\\int_{\\R^{k-1}}f(u',0)\\,\\dd u'$。两侧一致。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[斯托克斯]\\label{thm:b3:forms:stokes}", "设 $M \\subseteq \\R^n$ 为紧的定向", "带边 $k$ 维子流形，$\\partial M$ 赋予诱导定向，", "并设 $\\omega$ 为光滑的 $(k-1)$ 形式，定义在", "$M$ 的邻域上。则\\index{斯托克斯定理}", "\\[", "\\int_M\\dd\\omega = \\int_{\\partial M}\\omega .", "\\]", "特别地，若 $\\partial M = \\varnothing$，", "则 $\\int_M\\dd\\omega = 0$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "用有限个直接坐标卡（内部或边界）的像覆盖紧集 $M$，", "并取单位分解", "$(\\chi_i)$，从属于对应的开集 $W_i$", "（$\\R^n$ 中，见\\cref{lem:b3:forms:partition}），且 $\\sum\\chi_i", "= 1$ 于 $M$ 的某邻域上。在该邻域上", "$\\dd(\\sum\\chi_i) = 0$，于是", "\\[", "\\int_M\\dd\\omega = \\sum_i\\int_M\\dd(\\chi_i\\omega),", "\\qquad", "\\int_{\\partial M}\\omega =", "\\sum_i\\int_{\\partial M}\\chi_i\\omega :", "\\]", "两边都可加，故只需对", "支集位于单个坐标卡像中的形式证明该定理。", "", "\\emph{内部坐标卡。}若 $\\operatorname{supp}\\omega \\cap M", "\\subseteq \\gamma(V)$，$V$ 为 $\\R^k$ 中的开集：令 $\\eta =", "\\gamma^*\\omega$ 以零延拓到 $\\R^k$（光滑，紧支集", "位于 $V$ 中），并应用\\cref{lem:b3:forms:halfspace}，", "使支集远离 $\\partial H^k$（将 $V$ 平移入", "开上半空间 --- 或直接重复 $i < k$ 情形的", "在整个 $\\R^k$ 上的计算）：$\\int_M\\dd\\omega =", "\\int_{\\R^k}\\dd\\eta = 0$，又 $\\int_{\\partial M}\\omega = 0$，", "因为 $\\omega$ 在 $\\partial M$ 附近为零。", "", "\\emph{边界坐标卡。}若 $\\operatorname{supp}\\omega\\cap M", "\\subseteq \\gamma(V \\cap H^k)$：令 $\\eta = \\gamma^*\\omega$", "以零延拓，", "$\\gamma^*(\\dd\\omega) = \\dd\\eta$", "（\\cref{thm:b3:forms:pullback}(b)），于是", "由\\cref{def:b3:forms:integral}，有：", "\\[", "\\int_M\\dd\\omega = \\int_{H^k}\\dd\\eta", "\\overset{\\text{\\cref{lem:b3:forms:halfspace}}}{=}", "\\int_{\\partial H^k}\\eta .", "\\]", "还需将右端与 $\\int_{\\partial", "M}\\omega$ 相等。边界参数化为 $\\beta(u') =", "\\gamma(u', 0)$，而 $\\beta^*\\omega$ 为", "$\\eta$ 在 $\\{u_k = 0\\}$ 上的限制（沿包含映射 $u'", "\\mapsto (u', 0)$ 与 $\\gamma$ 复合的拉回）。定向", "比较在两侧都是 $(-1)^k$：标架", "$(\\partial_1\\beta, \\dots, \\partial_{k-1}\\beta)$ 位于", "$\\partial M$ 的诱导定向中，符号为", "$\\det(-e_k, e_1, \\dots, e_{k-1}) = (-1)^k$，在坐标卡中算得", "（外法向量拉回为 $-e_k$），恰是", "联系 $\\partial H^k$ 的诱导定向", "与 $\\R^{k-1}$ 标准定向的符号", "（见\\cref{lem:b3:forms:halfspace}）。两个符号约定", "相互抵消：", "$\\int_{\\partial H^k}\\eta = \\int_{\\partial M}\\omega$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[经典定理]", "\\label{ex:b3:forms:classical}", "设 $D \\subseteq \\R^2$ 为具光滑边界的紧区域，", "取标准定向。对 $\\omega = P\\,\\dd x +", "Q\\,\\dd y$：$\\dd\\omega = \\bigl(\\partial_xQ -", "\\partial_yP\\bigr)\\dd x\\wedge\\dd y$，斯托克斯公式为", "\\[", "\\int_D\\Bigl(\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial x} -", "\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial y}\\Bigr)\\dd x\\,\\dd y", "= \\oint_{\\partial D}P\\,\\dd x + Q\\,\\dd y :", "\\]", "\\emph{格林--黎曼公式}，已在", "本科二年级分册中对初等区域证明，并在此以自然的一般形式给出。在 $\\R^3$ 中，", "将斯托克斯公式用于向量场通量的 $2$-形式，", "在紧区域上得到\\emph{散度定理}：", "$\\int_\\Omega\\operatorname{div}F =", "\\int_{\\partial\\Omega}\\langle F, \\nu\\rangle\\,\\dd S$，又将", "它用于带边曲面上的 $1$-形式，则得到", "经典的\\emph{开尔文--斯托克斯}旋度定理；", "详见\\cref{exo:b3:forms:7}，其中列出两种对应关系。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{环绕数}\\label{sec:b3:forms:winding}", "", "\\begin{definition}\\label{def:b3:forms:winding}", "设 $\\gamma\\colon\\intcc01\\to\\R^2\\setminus\\{a\\}$ 为光滑", "闭曲线。其\\emph{环绕数}\\index{环绕", "数}关于点 $a$ 定义为：", "\\[", "\\operatorname{Ind}_\\gamma(a) =", "\\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_\\gamma\\omega_\\theta^a,", "\\qquad", "\\omega_\\theta^a = \\frac{(x - a_1)\\,\\dd y - (y - a_2)\\,\\dd", "x}{(x - a_1)^2 + (y - a_2)^2} .", "\\]", "\\end{definition}", ""]}